factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  The reel_script says the service 'started today' (இன்று தொடங்கியது), but the article only says it was launched on Friday; 'today' is not stated in the article.
  The reel_script calls it a 'நேரடி' (direct) bus service, which the article does not state; the article says a fast bus was extended to pass through Gobi.
  The reel_script and caption omit that the existing bus route was extended to Gobi; the reel_script says 'இப்போது' 'அந்தப் பேருந்து' is now operated via Gobi but the caption says the same bus 'also' runs via Gobi, which is consistent, but the slides call it a new 'எந்த வழித்தடம்' service run by the transport corporation, which matches the article.
  The caption's 'இந்தப் பேருந்து கோபி வழியாகவும்' and the reel's claim that the Coimbatore route was replaced are inconsistent: the reel says the bus 'இப்போது கோபி வழியாக இயக்கப்படுகிறது' (now runs via Gobi, implying a change), while the article indicates the route was extended to Gobi.
  The caption and tamil_headline describe the service as 'புதிய' (new) and the slides say it is a new start, but the article describes it as an extension of an existing route, so 'new service' is an unsupported characterisation.
  The caption gives the date as 27 November 2026 (வெள்ளிக்கிழமை) in the body, which is an invented date not in the article; the article only says Friday.
